  ],
  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "unknown",
      "name": "Unknown",
      "description": "Location: Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "path": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "type": "area"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 15,
      "actor": "she",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Listen up,\"",
        "line": 21
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 17,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Here's what I'm thinking.\"",
        "line": 25
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 21,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"He's out there. Somewhere. And he's either fighting his way back to us, or he's waiting for us to find him. Either way, we march.\"",
        "line": 31
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 34,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"How many you want?\"",
        "line": 48
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 36,
      "actor": "Mika",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Twenty,\"",
        "line": 51
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 37,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Things always go sideways,\"",
        "line": 53
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 39,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Exactly. So I want people who are good at it.\"",
        "line": 56
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 41,
      "actor": "someone",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"What about command here?\"",
        "line": 59
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 49,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Ten days,\"",
        "line": 69
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 51,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Ten days to march to the crash site, search it, and get back. Tight, but doable if we push.\"",
        "line": 72
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 59,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Miss him?\"",
        "line": 84
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 63,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Could be,\"",
        "line": 90
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 67,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Obviously. Someone needs to keep you from doing anything stupid.\"",
        "line": 96
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 69,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Fair assessment.\"",
        "line": 99
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 73,
      "actor": "Sera",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Question,\"",
        "line": 105
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 74,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then we expand the search.\"",
        "line": 107
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 76,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And if we run into whoever caused the crash? Because someone knocked that ship out of the sky, and I'm guessing they're not friendly.\"",
        "line": 110
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 77,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then they get to explain themselves.\"",
        "line": 112
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 89,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Listen up,\"",
        "line": 129
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 93,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Avoid contact when possible. When impossible, end it quickly and keep moving. We're not here to fight a war. We're here to find one man and bring him home.\"",
        "line": 135
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 94,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"What if he's\u2014\"",
        "line": 137
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 96,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"He's alive,\"",
        "line": 140
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 99,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Good. We march in five. Check your gear, check your buddy, and prepare for a week of pain.\"",
        "line": 145
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 111,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We'll hit the contested zone around midday tomorrow,\"",
        "line": 164
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 113,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"How recent is this intelligence?\"",
        "line": 167
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 114,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Two weeks old. Could be completely different now.\"",
        "line": 169
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 119,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"More likely to run into bandits, though.\"",
        "line": 176
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 120,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I'll take bandits over trained soldiers any day. Bandits run when the fighting gets hard.\"",
        "line": 178
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 123,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then they'll learn.\"",
        "line": 183
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 125,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Tomorrow's always interesting with you, Commander.\"",
        "line": 186
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 131,
      "actor": "she",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Hang on,\"",
        "line": 194
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 139,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Movement. Ridge line, eleven o'clock.\"",
        "line": 208
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 144,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Probably. We're not exactly stealthy with twenty bodies.\"",
        "line": 215
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 146,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Show them we're not.\"",
        "line": 218
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 153,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Smart,\"",
        "line": 229
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 155,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Or they're flanking us.\"",
        "line": 232
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 169,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Everywhere!\"",
        "line": 252
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 176,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Nature magic!\"",
        "line": 262
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 195,
      "actor": "she",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"They're tough!\"",
        "line": 288
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 199,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This is insane!\"",
        "line": 294
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 201,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We're trespassing,\"",
        "line": 297
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 203,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Little busy for etiquette lessons!\"",
        "line": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 206,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Trespassers. Despoilers. You bring war-stink into sacred groves. You will feed the soil.\"",
        "line": 305
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 211,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"All who bear weapons despoil. All who march in formation bring war. The forest will reclaim what humanity stole.\"",
        "line": 312
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 218,
      "actor": "she",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Sera,\"",
        "line": 321
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 219,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Enough for what you're thinking, if you're thinking something suitably dramatic.\"",
        "line": 323
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 220,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Always am.\"",
        "line": 325
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 227,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Everyone through!\"",
        "line": 335
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 235,
      "actor": "Mika",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Everyone accounted for?\"",
        "line": 347
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 236,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"All present,\"",
        "line": 349
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 238,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"He can complain all he wants as long as he can still scout.\"",
        "line": 352
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 240,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We're close,\"",
        "line": 355
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 242,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then we rest here for two hours, tend injuries, and push for the crash site before dark.\"",
        "line": 358
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 246,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Rest up,\"",
        "line": 364
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 248,
      "actor": "Kress",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Any theories?\"",
        "line": 367
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 274,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cCommander,\u201d",
        "line": 403
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 282,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cWith respect, Commander,\u201d",
        "line": 413
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 291,
      "actor": "Mika",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cThey\u2019ll build something,\u201d",
        "line": 426
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 294,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cCommander,\u201d",
        "line": 431
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 298,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cNot alive,\u201d",
        "line": 437
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 299,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cGo,\u201d",
        "line": 439
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 315,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Search this entire ruin,\"",
        "line": 459
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "thought",
      "timestamp": 416,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "think",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"he\"",
        "line": 569
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 424,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Oreck?\"",
        "line": 580
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 435,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The trail,\"",
        "line": 594
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "thought",
      "timestamp": 465,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "think",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Born leader?\"",
        "line": 631
      }
    }
  ],
